onal', '                :class:`~simplebench.reporters.reporter.options.ReporterOptions`', '                instance for additional configurations specific to a specific reporter.', "                If ``None``, reports default to the reporter's default options.", ':type options: :class:`~simplebench.reporters.reporter.options.ReporterOptions` | None', ':param extra: Any additional metadata associated with the choice.', ':type extra: Any | None', ''])
