   Containers for benchmark statistics


.. py:class:: OperationTimings(*, iterations: ~typing.Sequence[~simplebench.iteration.Iteration] | None = None, unit: str = 'ns', scale: float = 1e-09, rounds: int = 1, data: ~typing.Sequence[int | float] | None = None)
