rence external" href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/functions.html#bool" title="(in Python v3.14)"><span class="pre">bool</span></a><span class="w"> </span><span class="p"><span class="pre">|</span></span><span class="w"> </span><a class="reference external" href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/constants.html#None" title="(in Python v3.14)"><span class="pre">None</span></a></em><a class="headerlink" href="#simplebench.reporters.choice.choice.Choice.file_unique" title="Link to this definition">🔗</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Whether to make output file names unique.</p>\n<p>If specified, the associated <a class="reference internal" href="simplebench.reporters.reporter.html#simplebench.reporters.reporter.Reporter" title="simplebench.reporters.reporter.Reporter"><code class="xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Reporter</span></code></a> subclass\nshould use this setting for output files when this choice\nis selected. If <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">None</span></code>, the reporter’s default file_unique\nsetting should be used.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class="py property">\n<dt class="sig sig-object py" id="simplebench.reporters.choice.choice.Choice.flag_type">\n<em class="property"><span class="pre">property</span><span class="w"> </span></em><span class="sig-name descname"><span class="pre">flag_type</span></span><em class="property"><span class="p"><span class="pre">:</span></span><span class="w"> </span><a class="reference internal" href="simplebench.enums.html#simplebench.enums.FlagType" title="simplebench.enums.flag_type.FlagType"><span class="pre">FlagType</span></a></em><a class="headerlink" href="#simplebench.reporters.choice.choice.Choice.flag_type" title="Link to this definition">🔗</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The type of command-line flag (e.g., <a class="reference internal" href="simplebench.enums.html#simplebench.enums.FlagType.BOOLEAN" title="simplebench.enums.FlagType.BOOLEAN"><code class="xref py py-attr docutils