ight"><pre><span></span><span class="p">[</span><span class="s1">&#39;--json&#39;</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="s1">&#39;--json-full&#39;</span><span class="p">]</span>\n</pre></div>\n</div>\n<p>The <a class="reference internal" href="#simplebench.reporters.choice.choice.Choice.description" title="simplebench.reporters.choice.choice.Choice.description"><code class="xref py py-attr docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">description</span></code></a> property of the <a class="reference internal" href="#simplebench.reporters.choice.choice.Choice" title="simplebench.reporters.choice.choice.Choice"><code class="xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Choice</span></code></a> is used to provide\nhelp text for the flags when generating command-line help.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class="py property">\n<dt class="sig sig-object py" id="simplebench.reporters.choice.choice.Choice.name">\n<em class="property"><span class="pre">property</span><span class="w"> </span></em><span class="sig-name descname"><span class="pre">name</span></span><em class="property"><span class="p"><span class="pre">:</span></span><span class="w"> </span><a class="reference external" href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/stdtypes.html#str" title="(in Python v3.14)"><span class="pre">str</span></a></em><a class="headerlink" href="#simplebench.reporters.choice.choice.Choice.name" title="Link to this definition">🔗</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Name of the choice.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class="py property">\n<dt class="sig sig-object py" id="simplebench.reporters.choice.choice.Choice.options">\n<em class="property"><span class="pre">property</span><span class="w"> </span></em><span class="sig-name descname"><span class="pre">options</span></span><em class="property"><span class="p"><span class="pre">:</span></span><span class="w"> </span><a class="reference internal" href="simplebench.reporters.reporter.options.html#simplebench.reporters.reporter.options.ReporterOptions" t