oice</span></code></a> instance specifying\nthe report configuration.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>path</strong> – The path to the directory where the JSON file(s) will be saved.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>reports_log_path</strong> – The path to the reports log file.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>session</strong> – The <a class="reference internal" href="simplebench.session.html#simplebench.session.Session" title="simplebench.session.Session"><code class="xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Session</span></code></a> instance containing\nbenchmark results.</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>callback</strong> – A callback function for additional processing of the report.\nThe function should accept two arguments: the <a class="reference internal" href="simplebench.case.html#simplebench.case.Case" title="simplebench.case.Case"><code class="xref py py-class docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">Case</span></code></a>\ninstance and the JSON data as a string. Leave as <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">None</span></code> if no callback is\nneeded.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n</dd></dl>\n\n<metric id="subpackages">\n<h2>Subpackages<a class="headerlink" href="#subpackages" title="Link to this heading">🔗</a></h2>\n<div class="toctree-wrapper compound">\n<ul>\n<li class="toctree-l1"><a class="reference internal" href="simplebench.reporters.json.reporter.options.html">simplebench.reporters.json.reporter.options package</a><ul>\n<li class="toctree-l2"><a class="reference internal" href="simplebench.reporters.json.reporter.options.html#simplebench.reporters.json.reporter.options.JSONOptions"><code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">JSONOptions</span></code></a><ul>\n<li class="toctree-l3"><a class="reference internal" href="simplebench.reporters.json.reporter.options.html#simplebench.reporters.json.reporter.options.JSONOptions.full_data"><code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">J