automatically in the <code class="docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">__post_init__</span></code> method.</p>\n<dl class="py attribute">\n<dt class="sig sig-object py" id="simplebench.reporters.reporter.config.ReporterConfig.name">\n<span class="sig-name descname"><span class="pre">name</span></span><a class="headerlink" href="#simplebench.reporters.reporter.config.ReporterConfig.name" title="Link to this definition">🔗</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The unique name for the reporter (e.g., ‘rich-table’).</p>\n<dl class="field-list simple">\n<dt class="field-odd">Type<span class="colon">:</span></dt>\n<dd class="field-odd"><p><a class="reference external" href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/stdtypes.html#str" title="(in Python v3.14)">str</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class="py attribute">\n<dt class="sig sig-object py" id="simplebench.reporters.reporter.config.ReporterConfig.description">\n<span class="sig-name descname"><span class="pre">description</span></span><a class="headerlink" href="#simplebench.reporters.reporter.config.ReporterConfig.description" title="Link to this definition">🔗</a></dt>\n<dd><p>A short description of what the reporter does.</p>\n<dl class="field-list simple">\n<dt class="field-odd">Type<span class="colon">:</span></dt>\n<dd class="field-odd"><p><a class="reference external" href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/stdtypes.html#str" title="(in Python v3.14)">str</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class="py attribute">\n<dt class="sig sig-object py" id="simplebench.reporters.reporter.config.ReporterConfig.metrics">\n<span class="sig-name descname"><span class="pre">metrics</span></span><a class="headerlink" href="#simplebench.reporters.reporter.config.ReporterConfig.metrics" title="Link to this definition">🔗</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The master set of metrics this reporter can handle.</p>\n<dl class="field-list simple">\n<dt class="field-odd">Type<span class="colon">:</span></dt>\n<dd class="field-odd"><p><a class="reference exter