ss="pre">Session</span></a><span class="w"> </span><span class="p"><span class="pre">|</span></span><span class="w"> </span><a class="reference external" href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/constants.html#None" title="(in Python v3.14)"><span class="pre">None</span></a></em><a class="headerlink" href="#simplebench.runners.SimpleRunner.session" title="Link to this definition">🔗</a></dt>\n<dd><p>The session in which the benchmark is run.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class="py property">\n<dt class="sig sig-object py" id="simplebench.runners.SimpleRunner.variation_marks">\n<em class="property"><span class="pre">property</span><span class="w"> </span></em><span class="sig-name descname"><span class="pre">variation_marks</span></span><em class="property"><span class="p"><span class="pre">:</span></span><span class="w"> </span><a class="reference external" href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/stdtypes.html#dict" title="(in Python v3.14)"><span class="pre">dict</span></a><span class="p"><span class="pre">[</span></span><a class="reference external" href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/stdtypes.html#str" title="(in Python v3.14)"><span class="pre">str</span></a><span class="p"><span class="pre">,</span></span><span class="w"> </span><a class="reference external" href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/typing.html#typing.Any" title="(in Python v3.14)"><span class="pre">Any</span></a><span class="p"><span class="pre">]</span></span></em><a class="headerlink" href="#simplebench.runners.SimpleRunner.variation_marks" title="Link to this definition">🔗</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Return the variation marks for the benchmark.</p>\n<p>The variation marks are defined by the <a class="reference internal" href="simplebench.case.html#simplebench.case.Case.variation_cols" title="simplebench.case.Case.variation_cols"><code class="xref py py-attr docutils literal notranslate"><span class="pre">variation_cols</span></code></a>\nand the current keyworded arguments to the function being benchmarked.