="(in Python v3.14)"><em>int</em></a><em>, </em><em>optional</em>) – Number of steps completed. Defaults to 0.</p></li>\n</ul>\n</dd>\n<dt class="field-even">Returns<span class="colon">:</span></dt>\n<dd class="field-even"><p>The created RichTask instance.</p>\n</dd>\n<dt class="field-odd">Return type<span class="colon">:</span></dt>\n<dd class="field-odd"><p><a class="reference internal" href="#simplebench.tasks.RichTask" title="simplebench.tasks.RichTask">RichTask</a></p>\n</dd>\n</dl>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class="py property">\n<dt class="sig sig-object py" id="simplebench.tasks.RichProgressTasks.progress">\n<em class="property"><span class="pre">property</span><span class="w"> </span></em><span class="sig-name descname"><span class="pre">progress</span></span><em class="property"><span class="p"><span class="pre">:</span></span><span class="w"> </span><a class="reference external" href="https://rich.readthedocs.io/en/latest/reference/progress.html#rich.progress.Progress" title="(in Rich)"><span class="pre">Progress</span></a></em><a class="headerlink" href="#simplebench.tasks.RichProgressTasks.progress" title="Link to this definition">🔗</a></dt>\n<dd><p>Get the Rich Progress instance.</p>\n</dd></dl>\n\n<dl class="py method">\n<dt class="sig sig-object py" id="simplebench.tasks.RichProgressTasks.start">\n<span class="sig-name descname"><span class="pre">start</span></span><span class="sig-paren">(</span><span class="sig-paren">)</span> <span class="sig-return"><span class="sig-return-icon">&#x2192;</span> <span class="sig-return-typehint"><a class="reference external" href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/constants.html#None" title="(in Python v3.14)"><span class="pre">None</span></a></span></span><a class="reference internal" href="../_modules/simplebench/tasks.html#RichProgressTasks.start"><span class="viewcode-link"><span class="pre">[source]</span></span></a><a class="headerlink" href="#simplebench.tasks.RichProgressTasks.start" title="Link to this definition